KONOHAGAKURE — SQUAD ROSTER: TEAM 10 (INO-SHIKA-CHO)

Jonin-sensei: Sarutobi, Asuma (Twelve Guardian Ninja, former)
Genin:
- Yamanaka, Ino — Mind Transfer Jutsu; sensory support.
- Nara, Shikamaru — Shadow Imitation Jutsu; strategist (200+ IQ).
- Akimichi, Choji — Body Expansion techniques; heavy assault.

Formation notes: The current generation of the traditional Ino-Shika-Cho trio, echoing their fathers' formation. Shikamaru directs, Ino disrupts and gathers intelligence, Choji delivers force. Highly effective capture and battlefield-control unit.

Status: Active. Shikamaru promoted to Chunin at the recent Selection Exams.
